  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37267038",
      "title": "Using a FutureBuilder for Loading Data",
      "lectureOrder": 269,
      "videoOrder": 252,
      "sourceHash": "46dcf5d18ddbda5961b0c0c13ed3e238eb4052e292ef77c67c8ca3c54ee5aebe",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.52,
          "end": 4.92,
          "en": "FutureBuilder is a built-in widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.92,
          "end": 6.81,
          "en": "that takes a future",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.81,
          "end": 9.3,
          "en": "and then will build a certain widget tree",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.3,
          "end": 11.4,
          "en": "once that future resolved,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.4,
          "end": 13.62,
          "en": "so once that future is done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.62,
          "end": 16.05,
          "en": "And it gives you this extra snapshot here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.05,
          "end": 18.6,
          "en": "besides the context in this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.6,
          "end": 20.58,
          "en": "which it will execute for you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.58,
          "end": 22.26,
          "en": "which simply gives you information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.26,
          "end": 24.273,
          "en": "about the current state of the future.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.53,
          "end": 26.91,
          "en": "So here for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 26.91,
          "end": 30.24,
          "en": "we can then take a look at this snapshot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.24,
          "end": 33,
          "en": "and if it's connectionState is equal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33,
          "end": 37.02,
          "en": "to connectionState.waiting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.02,
          "end": 39.03,
          "en": "I wanna show a loading spinner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.03,
          "end": 40.41,
          "en": "in the middle of the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 40.41,
          "end": 43.67,
          "en": "Otherwise I wanna show my PlacesList,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.7,
          "end": 45.663,
          "en": "so like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 46.77,
          "end": 48.18,
          "en": "So if we are still waiting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 48.18,
          "end": 50.46,
          "en": "I wanna use the center widget instead,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 50.46,
          "end": 52.08,
          "en": "which can be const",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 52.08,
          "end": 55.59,
          "en": "and center a CircularProgressIndicator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 55.59,
          "end": 56.99,
          "en": "in the middle of the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 58.53,
          "end": 61.02,
          "en": "That's what I wanna do if we're still waiting for the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 61.02,
          "end": 62.91,
          "en": "to be loaded from the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 62.91,
          "end": 64.71,
          "en": "Otherwise, once it was loaded,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 64.71,
          "end": 66.72,
          "en": "no matter if it's empty or not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 66.72,
          "end": 69.21000000000001,
          "en": "I wanna show the PlacesList.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 69.21000000000001,
          "end": 72.72,
          "en": "Now, the future I wanna use here is of course the future",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 72.72,
          "end": 75.72,
          "en": "that is yielded by loadPlaces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 75.72,
          "end": 77.28,
          "en": "Since we use async here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 77.28,
          "end": 79.26,
          "en": "this will always return a future,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 79.26,
          "end": 81.12,
          "en": "so we can update this return type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 81.12,
          "end": 83.31,
          "en": "to make this a bit clearer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 83.31,
          "end": 85.11,
          "en": "And it's this future I wanna wait for,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 85.11,
          "end": 88.173,
          "en": "because it's in here where I'm loading my places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 89.22,
          "end": 93.47999999999999,
          "en": "So to set this future here in places.dart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 93.47999999999999,
          "end": 98.47999999999999,
          "en": "we should actually convert this to a StatefulWidget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 98.61,
          "end": 103.56,
          "en": "or to a ConsumerStatefulWidget here to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 103.56,
          "end": 106.28999999999999,
          "en": "because we need such a StatefulWidget to be able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 106.28999999999999,
          "end": 109.44,
          "en": "to call initState in the state class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 109.44,
          "end": 110.82,
          "en": "And speaking of that, we should",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 110.82,
          "end": 115.82,
          "en": "of course add the _PlacesScreenState class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 115.83,
          "end": 117.993,
          "en": "which extends the ConsumerState,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 119.88,
          "end": 124.203,
          "en": "which is connected to PlacesScreen, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.58,
          "end": 129.603,
          "en": "And here we should close this class and add createState,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.71,
          "end": 135.6,
          "en": "where we return such a ConsumerState related to PlacesScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 135.6,
          "end": 139.503,
          "en": "and where we return a new instance of _PlacesScreenState.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.96,
          "end": 144.6,
          "en": "Now build no longer gets this ref,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.6,
          "end": 148.95,
          "en": "instead ref is now a generally available property here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 148.95,
          "end": 152.05,
          "en": "And now with that here we can add initState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153.6,
          "end": 156,
          "en": "and set up our future,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156,
          "end": 159.36,
          "en": "the future that will be connected to this FutureBuilder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.5,
          "end": 165.5,
          "en": "So for that here I'll add the _placesFuture property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 166.11,
          "end": 168.24,
          "en": "which will be of type Future",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 168.24,
          "end": 171.933,
          "en": "that will actually not yield any value once it's done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 173.52,
          "end": 176.28,
          "en": "And I'll decorate this or annotate this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.28,
          "end": 179.46,
          "en": "with the late keyword, which is a special Dart keyword",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.46,
          "end": 183.72,
          "en": "that in the end tell Dart that this is not set initially",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 183.72,
          "end": 186.57,
          "en": "when there class is instantiated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 186.57,
          "end": 190.23,
          "en": "but it will be set before it's really needed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.23,
          "end": 193.68,
          "en": "because we will indeed set it here in initState.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 193.68,
          "end": 197.053,
          "en": "Here, I'll set _placesFuture ==",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 198.18,
          "end": 199.74,
          "en": "using the ref keyword",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.74,
          "end": 204.74,
          "en": "and reading from the userPlacesProvider",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 205.05,
          "end": 207.42000000000002,
          "en": "and there from the notifier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 207.42000000000002,
          "end": 209.223,
          "en": "the result of calling loadPlaces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.29,
          "end": 212.73,
          "en": "This will then, behind the scenes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 212.73,
          "end": 215.25,
          "en": "load the places from the database,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 215.25,
          "end": 216.69,
          "en": "because that's this method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 216.69,
          "end": 219.6,
          "en": "and update the state of the provider,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 219.6,
          "end": 222.06,
          "en": "which is important for the build method thereafter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 222.06,
          "end": 225.24,
          "en": "because here I'm watching those places,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 225.24,
          "end": 228.12,
          "en": "but I will load the places from inside initState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 228.12,
          "end": 231.32999999999998,
          "en": "and store the future that's returned by loadPlaces,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 231.32999999999998,
          "end": 233.37,
          "en": "in _placesFuture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 233.37,
          "end": 235.8,
          "en": "And this now therefore does not just kick off",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 235.8,
          "end": 237.75,
          "en": "that loading process,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 237.75,
          "end": 240.67,
          "en": "but it also allows me to use _placesFuture",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 242.22,
          "end": 246.36,
          "en": "in my FutureBuilder so that this FutureBuilder makes sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 246.36,
          "end": 250.863,
          "en": "that we either see that loading spinner or the PlacesList.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 252.72,
          "end": 255.6,
          "en": "And with all that done, if you save everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 255.6,
          "end": 260.6,
          "en": "and reload the app, you should see, No places yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 261.15,
          "end": 264.12,
          "en": "But you also shouldn't see any errors here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 264.12,
          "end": 266.28,
          "en": "And also not in the debug console",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 266.28,
          "end": 267.63,
          "en": "if you take a look at that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 268.59,
          "end": 272.913,
          "en": "And if I now do add a new place here, like my office,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 274.77,
          "end": 277.59000000000003,
          "en": "where I take a picture, (phone chimes)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 277.59000000000003,
          "end": 282.59000000000003,
          "en": "get the current location and then choose Add Place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 282.65999999999997,
          "end": 287.58,
          "en": "this works, still no errors here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 287.58,
          "end": 290.46,
          "en": "and I'll also add a second place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 290.46,
          "end": 293.409,
          "en": "just to be sure that it really works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 293.409,
          "end": 295.17,
          "en": "(phone chimes)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 295.17,
          "end": 297.153,
          "en": "And pick this one on the map,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 300.63,
          "end": 302.07,
          "en": "save this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 302.07,
          "end": 304.26,
          "en": "Now the data is there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 304.26,
          "end": 309.26,
          "en": "I can of course also view these places, so that also works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 309.75,
          "end": 311.73,
          "en": "But now if I reload the app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 311.73,
          "end": 314.583,
          "en": "or even restart it to be super safe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 316.29,
          "end": 319.8,
          "en": "this also restarts and my places are still there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 319.8,
          "end": 321.9,
          "en": "and I can still view them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 321.9,
          "end": 323.64,
          "en": "So this still works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 323.64,
          "end": 327.36,
          "en": "And with that, we're now storing the data on the device.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 327.36,
          "end": 331.173,
          "en": "And of course this also all works on the iPhone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 332.4,
          "end": 337.2,
          "en": "There, we can also add new places by taking images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 337.2,
          "end": 340.29,
          "en": "and then getting the current location",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 340.29,
          "end": 342.99,
          "en": "or also by creating a new place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 342.99,
          "end": 346.62,
          "en": "and there selecting a place on the map.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 346.62,
          "end": 348.39,
          "en": "And there on the iPhone,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 348.39,
          "end": 351.65999999999997,
          "en": "you can also see that you cannot just visit those places,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 351.65999999999997,
          "end": 353.79,
          "en": "but that if you close the app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 353.79,
          "end": 357.36,
          "en": "and you restarted in the end, which I did here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 357.36,
          "end": 359.223,
          "en": "the places are still there.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
